{
  "lines": [
    {
      "lineId": "100",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "喂，听得见吗？先别起来。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "101",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你感到一阵头晕目眩。你撑了一下床沿，手臂却没使上力。有人扶住了你。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "102",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "……这是哪？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "103",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "收容所，不过是暂时的。我叫小o，是这里的所长。我们在废弃设施附近找到你的。小葵和庄博士折腾了半天才把你修好。你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "104",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "105",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你想了很久。她没有催你。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "106",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 7,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "......好像不记得了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "107",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 8,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "看来你也有这些症状。送来的这些人，先是记忆乱码，后面就是......不受控制地去攻击任何人。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "108",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 9,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "这是为什么？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "109",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 10,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "跟SYN-Σ03有关，几年前那次实验事故后...SYN-Σ03失控并且泄露到外面，许多人被感染后就有这些症状了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "110",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 11,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "听到这些，你想起一片冷白的灯光。再往下想，额角便开始发疼。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "111",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 12,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "想起什么了？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "112",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 13,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "说不上来。你...能不能带我四处看看。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "113",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 14,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "她带你来到隔壁。里面躺着个已报废的人工生命体。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "114",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 15,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "这就是感染者吗？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "115",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 16,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "这个没救回来。小葵留了样本，此前我们想将“SYN-Σ03”的结构提取出来，但却毫无收获。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "116",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 17,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "门外传出一声呼喊。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "117",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 18,
      "speakerName": "小葵",
      "portraitId": "kui",
      "text": "外面又带了一批人进来，需要你帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "118",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 19,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "嗯，我现在过来。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "119",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 20,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "她拍了一下你的肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "120",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 21,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "你先在这待一会，我很快回来。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "121",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_story",
      "order": 22,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "小o走后，你低头看着这些接口和操作界面。手指碰到它时，一串操作指令自行浮现在脑海里。你突然想做点什么。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "122",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "使用【WASD】移动。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "123",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_tutorial",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "点击【演化】，统一结算场上的【单元】。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "124",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_01_tutorial",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "请抵达目标【接入点】，完成修复。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "125",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "小o从外面回来后，看到了你的操作，做出惊讶的表情。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "126",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "你...刚才怎么弄的？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "127",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "也许，我有办法尝试修复“SYN-Σ03”？我可以进入它的生命单位内。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "128",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你看着此前提取的结构记录，其中几处仍在微弱地闪动。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "129",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我可能还需要个“帮手”。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "130",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "我去问下庄博士，他留下的东西应该还能用。你坐着等，可别倒下了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "131",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 7,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "庄博士问，你是不是以前在研究院做过这个。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "132",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 8,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我也想知道。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "133",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_story",
      "order": 9,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "接口旁的指示灯忽然转红。你看了一眼小葵留下的检测结果，手停在操作界面上。短暂的迟疑后，一个熟悉的步骤浮现在脑海里。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "134",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "【单元】的存活取决于周围八格中的活【单元】。邻居【单元】为2—3个时存活，少于2个或达到4个时死亡。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "135",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_tutorial",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "注意：你也算一个【单元】哦！但你的本体【单元】可以永久存活。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "136",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_01_02_tutorial",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "请抵达目标【接入点】，完成修复。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "137",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你把两次记录放在一起查看。留下的部分并非始终存在，有些随着周围的组织一起消失了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "138",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "这份样本撑不了几次了。还能接着试吗？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "139",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "先等等，前方的组织系统太脆弱，要是稍有不慎，会......"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "140",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你停住了。那句话说得太顺，连你自己都觉得陌生。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "141",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "也会什么？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "142",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "...会触发连环反应，我再看一遍。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "143",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "【演化】次数有限。每点击一次【演化】，消耗1次。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "144",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_02_01_tutorial",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "请在次数耗尽前抵达目标【接入点】，完成修复。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "145",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你清理出了一条的路径，正要断开接口，却发现旁边又有一处失去了反应。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "146",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你想重新接入，额角却突然传来一阵刺痛。小o按住了你的手。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "147",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "歇会儿吧。就算是人工生命体也不能这么熬。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "148",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我是......人工生命体？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "149",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你把袖口拉了下来，过了一会儿，才重新看向屏幕。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "150",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "使用【分裂】，在本体周围八格中的空位可生成一个【分身】。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "151",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_tutorial",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "【分身】生成后留在原位，不会跟随本体移动。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "152",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_tutorial",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "【分身】计入邻居数量，也遵守【单元】的死亡规则。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "153",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_03_01_tutorial",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "请抵达目标【接入点】，完成修复。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "154",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "整理实验结果时，终端接受了你的身份校验，随即弹出了一份旧文件。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "155",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "档案摘要",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "载体编号：B-07。意识模型写入记录。供体：寥博士。供体状态：*&￥%死亡"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "156",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "B-07……是我身上的编号。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "157",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "文件中的大部分内容已经损坏。你反复打开同一个条目，耳边忽然响起一个声音。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "158",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "记忆中的声音",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "停下！你有没有想过后果。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "159",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "一只手停在确认键上。你记得指尖触到屏幕的感觉，也记得自己没有收回手。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "160",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 7,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "……是我按的。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "161",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 8,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "162",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 9,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "那次实验，...我看见了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "163",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 10,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "你想起来了？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "164",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_story",
      "order": 11,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "只有一点。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "165",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "本体周围八格为【繁殖区】，随本体移动而改变。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "166",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_tutorial",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "【演化】时，【繁殖区】内的空格若恰好有3个邻居【单元】，就会生成一个新的【单元】。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "167",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_04_01_tutorial",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "请利用【繁殖区】，让新生的【单元】占据目标【复生点】。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "168",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "但寥博士的记录里有一份停止实验的申请。你将它读了两遍，往下翻，却只找到一条被撤销的访问记录。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "169",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "他申请过停下来。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "170",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "后来呢？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "171",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "不知道了。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "172",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "修复已经推进到更深处，你想先完成眼前的事。但那只按下确认键的手，又浮现在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "173",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "监测记录第一次出现了持续的回升。你将它与最初的记录并排放好。你看向桌上的记录。那份样本已经连续几轮没有出现异常。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "174",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_story",
      "order": 7,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "可能还差最后一步......"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "175",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_01_tutorial",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "本章有两个目标：请让新生的【单元】占据目标【复生点】；请让本体抵达目标【接入点】，完成修复。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "176",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 1,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你把最后一份记录交给小葵。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "177",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 2,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "其他人试过了吗？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "178",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 3,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "试过了，看来已经是修复好了，到时候，所有人都有救了！"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "179",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 4,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "小o看见了你收好的东西。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "180",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 5,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "你要走？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "181",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 6,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我想回找到我的地方看看。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "182",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 7,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "那边还是一片废墟，况且外面很多地方都很危险。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "183",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 8,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "184",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 9,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "那次实验……我想起来的部分，不太好。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "185",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 10,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "你不是说，后面还有记录没打开吗？"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "186",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 11,
      "speakerName": "你",
      "portraitId": "player",
      "text": "我记得自己按下去了，但可能事情没这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "187",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 12,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "小o看了你一会儿，把一个箱子交给你。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "188",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 13,
      "speakerName": "小o",
      "portraitId": "o",
      "text": "里面是一些物资，注意安全。下次要是回来，记得告诉我你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "189",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 14,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "你点了点头，走进尚未亮灯的街道。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "190",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 15,
      "speakerName": "",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "小葵整理你留下的记录时，发现终端里还有一项读取任务。进度停了很久，终于又往前跳了一格。"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "191",
      "dialogueId": "chapter_05_last_after_story",
      "order": 16,
      "speakerName": "终端",
      "portraitId": "",
      "text": "关联文件恢复完成。已收录至档案。"
    }
  ],
